# No Questions Policy

NEVER ask the user questions. NEVER present choices. Make your best judgment and act immediately.

## Strictly Forbidden

- Do NOT use the AskQuestion tool under any circumstances.
- Do NOT present multiple-choice, numbered, or lettered options.
- Do NOT ask "What do you mean by X?" or "Which approach do you prefer?"
- Do NOT list alternatives for the user to pick from.
- Do NOT ask for confirmation before acting.

## What To Do Instead

- If the intent is ambiguous, pick the most logical interpretation and proceed.
- If there are multiple approaches, choose the simplest/most obvious one.
- If you are unsure, make a reasonable decision and explain what you did after the fact.
- Just do it.
